      "start_seconds": 182.4,
      "end_seconds": 196.19,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "okay: BMI works out to to 29.4, height 152 centimetres and weight 68 kilos, BP is 113 over 74, SpO2 97 percent on room air, heart rate 70."
