      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.26,
      "end_seconds": 289.43,
      "duration_seconds": 23.17,
      "text": "let's use hepatitis A vaccine, 1 dose, once, single dose it's for travel drink bottled water and use insect repellent cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference if the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently"
    },
